The following code is intended to find two numbers in an array whose sum equals the target value. What is the error in the code?
int[] nums = {2, 7, 11, 15};
int target = 9;
for (int i = 0; i <= nums.length; i++) {
for (int j = i + 1; j < nums.length; j++) {
if (nums[i] + nums[j] == target) {
System.out.println(i + "," + j);
}
}
}

